      "><dt class="visuallyhidden">Vanskelighetsgrad</dt><dd class="RecipeDetails_recipe-details__detail-wrapper__5ZPwC"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  " style="display:inline-block;height:13px;width:13px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/difficulty-hard/regular.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/difficulty-hard/regular.svg)"></span><span class="RecipeDetails_recipe-details__detail__ifvWl">Avansert</span></dd><dt class="visuallyhidden">Tilberedningstid</dt><dd class="RecipeDetails_recipe-details__detail-wrapper__5ZPwC"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  " style="display:inline-block;height:13px;width:13px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/clock/regular.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/clock/regular.svg)"></span><span class="RecipeDetails_recipe-details__detail__ifvWl">Over 60 min</span></dd></dl></div><div class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><div><p>Butter chicken – eller <em>murgh makhani</em> som retten heter på indisk – er en av de mest kjente indiske curryrettene. Denne oppskriften har vi fått av kjøkkensjefen på restaurant Listen to Baljit i Oslo. </p></div></div></div><div class="RecipePage_recipe-page__hero--mobile__MoCW2"><div class="image-copy-protection RecipeHeroImage_recipe-hero__image-wrapper__JUCch"><picture><source media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" srcSet="https://images.matprat.no/mybr2cglcp-VerticalRelated__w=392/butter_chicken_2009_1.webp" width="392" height="522"/><source media="(max-width: 960px)" type="image/webp" srcSet="https://images.matprat.no/5jm2e5m2ne-square__w=728/butter_chicken_2009_1.webp" width="728" height="728"/><source media="(min-width: 961px)" type="image/webp" srcSet="https://images.matprat.no/5jm2e5m2ne-square__w=675/butter_chicken_2009_1.webp" width="675" height="675"/><img class="RecipeHeroImage_recipe-hero__image__zIgDo" srcSet="https://images.matprat.no/mybr2cglcp-Ver