      CarouselTeasers_carousel-teasers__btn--active__Oudfn
      " type="button" id="carousel-next-btn-recipe-related-teasers"><span class="Icon_icon__6arAI Icon_icon--black__tBJOi  CarouselTeasers_carousel-teasers__btn-icon__zaZ_q" style="display:inline-block;height:20px;width:20px;mask-image:url(url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/chevron-right/regular.svg));-webkit-mask-image:url(https://www.matprat.no/Icons/common/chevron-right/regular.svg)"></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="RecipePage_recipe-page__hero--desktop__aakQM"><div class="YouTubeBlock_youtube-button__wrapper__5OJLP "><button class="YouTubeBlock_youtube-button__button__t_w5u" aria-label="Spill av video " type="button"><img class="YouTubeBlock_youtube-button__thumbnail__9KFxA" src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/NwlfMV747vI/maxresdefault.jpg" alt=""/><div class="YouTubeIcon_youtube-icon__wrapper__J_AlX" style="width:50px;height:35.3px"><svg class="YouTubeIcon_youtube-icon__svg__7ku2T " height="100%" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 68 48" width="100%"><path class="YouTubeIcon_youtube-icon__path__n_fFx" d="M66.52,7.74c-0.78-2.93-2.49-5.41-5.42-6.19C55.79,.13,34,0,34,0S12.21,.13,6.9,1.55 C3.97,2.33,2.27,4.81,1.48,7.74C0.06,13.05,0,24,0,24s0.06,10.95,1.48,16.26c0.78,2.93,2.49,5.41,5.42,6.19 C12.21,47.87,34,48,34,48s21.79-0.13,27.1-1.55c2.93-0.78,4.64-3.26,5.42-6.19C67.94,34.95,68,24,68,24S67.94,13.05,66.52,7.74z" fill="#212121"></path><path d="M 45,24 27,14 27,34" fill="#fff"></path></svg></div></button></div></div><div id="instructions" class="undefined RecipePage_recipe-page__scroll-traget__7upt_"><div class="RecipeProcess_process__g_Epj"><div class="RecipeProcess_process__header__7JRmG"><h2 class="display--M">Slik gjør du</h2></div><div class="RecipeProcess_process__wake-lock__B7itz"></div><ol class="RecipeSteps_recipe-steps__list__BlhdR"><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/mus6r376st-normal/710/01_kylling_hvitlok.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256553"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">1.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Fjern skinnet på kyllingen og tørk den godt. Kutt dype snitt i kjøttet på hele kyllingen. Finhakk hvitløk og bland med revet ingefær og sitronsaft, og gni kyllingen godt inn med blandingen. Dryss over litt salt. Sett kaldt i 20 minutter.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/24dh3he6rf-normal/710/02_marinade_skaal.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256554"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">2.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Bland sammen chilipulver, garam masala, olje og yoghurt. Tørk kyllingen med litt kjøkkenpapir og gni den godt inn med yoghurtblandingen. Plasser kyllingen på et fat og sett den kaldt i minst 4-6 timer, helst over natten.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256555"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">3.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Stek kyllingen midt i stekeovnen ved 200 °C, eller grill den til den er gyllenbrun og gjennomstekt, ca. 50 min. - 1 time.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/yqlatqpf4u-normal/710/06_revet_kylling.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256556"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">4.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Avkjøl og plukk kjøttet av beina i store biter.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/xanmhlfafq-normal/710/03_cashewnotter_skaal.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256557"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">5.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Lag smør- og tomatcurry: Bløtlegg cashewnøtter i litt lunkent vann i minst 30 minutter. Hell av vannet og mos nøttene i hurtigmikser eller med stavmikser. Sett til side.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/37c5f82ctj-normal/710/04_kutte_tomat.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256558"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">6.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span><p>Del tomater i biter. Varm en sauteringspanne med olje og fres tomater, hvitløk, ingefær, chilipulver, kardemomme og bukkehornkløver på middels varme til tomatene er helt myke.</p></span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/knalqq7xvm-normal/710/05_cashewnotter_panne.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256559"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">7.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Tilsett cashewpuré og bruk stavmikser eller hurtigmikser til å finmose sausen. Sil gjerne sausen gjennom en grov sikt for å få ut rester av skall, hvis du vil ha den ekstra fin.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/tcn6fglvye-normal/710/07_kylling_saus.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256560"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">8.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Ha sausen tilbake i kjelen og la den småkoke i i noen minutter. Smak til med honning, finhakket grønn chili, salt og pepper. Visp inn fløte og romtemperert smør i den varme sausen.</span></span></span></label></li><li class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__JC1cw"><div class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__media__xyDsL "><img class="RecipeStep_recipe-step__image__MpUJi" src="https://images.matprat.no/adpgh7kkhs-normal/710/08_drysse_notter.webp" alt="Butter chicken trinnbilder"/></div><label class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__CKZcu "><input class="visuallyhidden" type="checkbox" id="1256561"/><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__placeholder__wYpN3"></span><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text__s_VqB"><span class="RecipeCheckbox_recipe-chexbox__text-number__lsejZ">9.</span><span class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><span>Legg kyllingbitene i sausen og la alt bli gjennomvarmt. Pynt med koriander.</span></span></span></label></li></ol><div class="RecipeProcess_process__text__PaMsd RecipeProcess_process__after__xYqvg"><div class="TextBlock_text-block__2Ryte"><div><p>Server rykende varm med basmatiris og/eller <a title="Nanbrød" href="/oppskrifter/kos/nanbrod/">naanbrød</a>.</p>
<p> </p>
